   "id": "m14",
   "kb": "images",
   "type": "procedure",
   "q": "What are the steps to create a new project in TaskFlow Pro?",
   "answerable": true,
   "secs": 57.9,
   "error": null,
   "answer": "1. Go to **Projects** and click **New Project**. 2. Enter a **Project Name** and a 2-6 letter **Project Key** (used as a task prefix, e.g. WEB-142). 3. Choose a **Template**: Kanban, Scrum, Waterfall, or Blank. 4. Set the **Start Date** and **Target End Date**. 5. Choose **Visibility**: Team members only, Entire workspace, or Private.",
